{"content": "The sequence provided is **2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13, ...**\n\nThis is the sequence of **prime numbers** (natural numbers greater than 1 that have no positive divisors other than 1 and themselves).\n\nLet's verify the pattern:\n- **2**: Prime (divisible only by 1 and 2)\n- **3**: Prime (divisible only by 1 and 3)\n- **4**: Not prime (divisible by 2)\n- **5**: Prime\n- **6**: Not prime (divisible by 2 and 3)\n- **7**: Prime\n- **8, 9, 10**: Not prime\n- **11**: Prime\n- **12**: Not prime\n- **13**: Prime\n\nThe next number after 13 is **14**, which is not prime ($2 \\times 7$).\nThe number after that is **15**, which is not prime ($3 \\times 5$).\nThe next number is **16**, which is not prime ($4 \\times 4$).\nThe next number is **17**, which is only", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.01914176516708821, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.01914176516708821}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -4.551181407501073}, {"token": "This", "logprob": -5.028441997100682}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -6.987113566924901}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -7.367896647979588}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -9.433200450469823}, {"token": "Looking", "logprob": -9.757396312286229}, {"token": "Next", "logprob": -10.20955237918076}, {"token": "Comple", "logprob": -10.454600902129979}, {"token": "These", "logprob": -11.33105239443955}, {"token": "That", "logprob": -11.90847930483994}, {"token": "There", "logprob": -12.050416560699315}, {"token": "Complete", "logprob": -12.154910655547948}, {"token": "Following", "logprob": -12.248419375945897}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -12.34261188082871}, {"token": "By", "logprob": -12.36885127597031}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -12.451487155486912}, {"token": "Sequence", "logprob": -12.593230815460057}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -12.782947154571385}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -12.798020930816502}]}, {"token": " sequence", "logprob": -0.19263227094027613, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " sequence", "logprob": -