{"content": "The sequence provided (2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13) consists of **prime numbers** in ascending order.\n\nA prime number is a natural number greater than 1 that has no positive divisors other than 1 and itself.\n- 2, 3, 5, 7, 11, and 13 are all prime.\n- The next number after 13 is 14, but $14 = 2 \\times 7$, so it is not prime.\n- The number after 14 is **15**, which is divisible by 3 and 5.\n- The next number is **16**, which is even.\n- The next number is **17**, which is only divisible by 1 and 17.\n\nTherefore, the next number in the sequence is **17**.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.01914176516708821, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.01914176516708821}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -4.551181407501073}, {"token": "This", "logprob": -5.028441997100682}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -6.987113566924901}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -7.367896647979588}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -9.433200450469823}, {"token": "Looking", "logprob": -9.757396312286229}, {"token": "Next", "logprob": -10.20955237918076}, {"token": "Comple", "logprob": -10.454600902129979}, {"token": "These", "logprob": -11.33105239443955}, {"token": "That", "logprob": -11.90847930483994}, {"token": "There", "logprob": -12.050416560699315}, {"token": "Complete", "logprob": -12.154910655547948}, {"token": "Following", "logprob": -12.248419375945897}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -12.34261188082871}, {"token": "By", "logprob": -12.36885127597031}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -12.451487155486912}, {"token": "Sequence", "logprob": -12.593230815460057}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -12.782947154571385}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -12.798020930816502}]}, {"token": " sequence", "logprob": -0.19263227094027613, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " sequence", "logprob": -0.19263227094027613}, {"token": " next", "logprob": -1.8274951707205496}, {"token": " given", "logprob": -5.129369331487151}, {"token": " numbers", "logprob": -5.39101941693637}, {"token": " missing